	"tips": "・Care Worker visa is for **care work at care facilities**\n\n・Requires **national qualification as a Certified Care Worker**. EPA care worker experience is also valid\n\n・Check the latest application requirements at the [Immigration Services Agency](https://www.moj.go.jp/isa/)\n\n・The employing care facility must meet **appropriate facility standards**\n\n・Japanese language proficiency is crucial due to the nature of care work",
